Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- Sticky Notes (sg-sticky). `stikynot` in the Run box, and
; ShellExecute of stikynot.exe (Windows 7's Sticky Notes' name, which scripts and
; guides still use), open it.
;
; The path is the package's install location reached through Z:. If Z: is ever
; removed from the prefix for isolation, this must move with it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\App Paths\stikynot.exe]
@="Z:\\usr\\libexec\\stained-glass\\shell\\sg-sticky64.exe"
